/*!
\page page_strichmcpixel StRichMCPixel

\brief \ref page_strichmcpixel "StRichMCPixel" — MC RICH pad pixel augmented with per-particle truth records.

\section strichmcpixel_overview Overview
StRichMCPixel extends \ref page_strichpixel "StRichPixel" with a collection of
\ref page_strichmcinfo "StRichMCInfo" truth records. Multiple simulated particles
can contribute charge to a single pad; each contribution is recorded separately,
enabling reconstruction algorithms to trace pad signals back to their
generator-level origin.

\section strichmcpixel_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StRichPixel
        └── StRichMCPixel
\endcode

\section strichmcpixel_members Data Members
| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| StSPtrVecRichMCInfo | mInfo | Owned collection of MC truth records, one per contributing particle |

All data members of \ref page_strichpixel "StRichPixel" are also inherited.

\section strichmcpixel_methods Key Methods
| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| int contributions() const | Number of contributing MC particles |
| void addInfo(StRichMCInfo*) | Append an MC truth record |
| void setInfo(StSPtrVecRichMCInfo&) | Replace the entire MC truth collection |
| StSPtrVecRichMCInfo& getMCInfo() | Return the MC truth collection |

\section strichmcpixel_example Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StRichCollection* rich = event->richCollection();
StSPtrVecRichPixel& pixels = rich->getRichPixels();
for (const auto& pix : pixels) {
    StRichMCPixel* mcPix = dynamic_cast<StRichMCPixel*>(pix);
    if (!mcPix) continue;
    for (const auto& info : mcPix->getMCInfo())
        std::cout << "  GEANT PID=" << info->gid() << "\n";
}
\endcode

\section strichmcpixel_related Related Classes
\ref page_strichpixel "StRichPixel" — base raw pixel. \n
\ref page_strichmcinfo "StRichMCInfo" — individual truth record. \n
\ref page_strichmchit "StRichMCHit" — MC truth at the reconstructed-hit level.
*/
